[[Trick-or-Treat Bag]] is a [[container]] commonly obtained from various activities during [[Halloween]].

== Acquisition ==
=== Gathered from ===
{{gathered from}}

=== Dropped by ===
* Can drop from any mob in open-world during the [[Halloween]] festival.
{{dropped by}}

=== Contained in ===
* During Halloween, most reward boxes called "''<NPC Name> Loot Box''" from [[PvP Reward Track]]s and [[WvW Reward Track]]s, as they simulate mob drops.
{{contained in}}

