== Notes ==
* While Toilet Paper does not appear in the preview window, it still dropped from them as of Halloween 2023.
* Drop rate research can be found [[Trick-or-Treat Bag/research|here for contents]] and [[Trick-or-Treat Bag/research/drops per bag|here for drops per bag]].
* Has a similar loot table to [[Personalized Trick-or-Treat Bag]], but drops items in smaller quantities and has a lower chance to contain valuable items.
* The similarly named item, [[10 Slot Trick-or-Treat Bag]], is an actual inventory [[bag]].

